ight',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#0B1B3F">{t("Preguntas rápidas")}</h2><p style="margin:0;max-width:640px;font:400 16px/1.5 'Inter Tight',sans-serif;color:#3d5a85">{t("Lo que más nos preguntan al empezar.")}</p></div><div id="preguntas" style="scroll-margin-top:90px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f1f6ff);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.95);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 #fff,0 12px 32px rgba(26,115,232,.12);padding:6px 28px">{h.items.map((it) => (<><div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e6eef9"><button type="button" data-help-toggle="" aria-expanded={it.exp} style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;width:100%;padding:20px 0;border:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font:600 17px/1.35 'Inter Tight',sans-serif;color:#0B1B3F"><span>{t(it.q)}</span><span style={it.icon}>{t("+")}</span></button><div style={it.ans}>{t(it.a)}</div></div></>))}</div><div style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f1f6ff);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.95);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 #fff,0 12px 32px rgba(26,115,232,.12);padding:clamp(24px,4vw,40px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px 32px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:560px"><b style="font:600 24px/1.2 'Inter Tight',sans-serif;color:#0B1B3F;letter-spacing:-.02em">{t("¿No encuentras lo que buscas?")}</b><span style="font:400 16px/1.55 'Inter Tight',sans-serif;color:#3d5a85">{t("Escríbenos y un asesor te ayuda. También puedes agendar una demo para resolver tus dudas en vivo.")}</span></div><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px"><a href={link("contacto", "")} style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:48px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;font:600 14.5px 'Inter Tight',sans-serif;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5aa8ff,#1A73E8);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.7),0 10px 22px rgba(35,105,240,.38)">{t("Hablar con soporte →")}</a><a href="https://softseguros.com/demo-softseguros-vsl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:48px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;font:600 14.5px 'Inter Tight',sans-serif;color:#0f2f63;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#e4f0ff);border:1px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(26,115,232,.16),inset 0 1px 0 #fff">{t("Agendar una demo")}</a></div></div></div> <div style="height:8px"></div> <div style="height:8px"></div> <div style="height:8px"></div> <div style="height:8px"></div> </div>
